    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ier5">
        <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e98">Caput 5</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_1@1-2">Circuite vias.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e113">Grandis amor justitiae ut non juxta interrogationem Abrahae, et responsionem Dei, quod pro decem viris justis liberet Deus civitatem, jamjamque perituram; sed si unum <pb ed="#P" n="0017B"/> invenerit, qui faciat judicium, et quaerat fidem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e120">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e122">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e124">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e126" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_3@1-3">Domine, oculi tui.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e129"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e130" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e133">Damnantur opera Judaeorum (in quibus juxta legis caeremonias exsultabant) per fidem Christianorum, per quam gratia salvi facti sumus.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e136">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e138" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_3@6-7">Percussisti eos.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e141"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e142" ref="#GregoryGreat">GREG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e145"><seg type="qs">Omnis divina percussio</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et est unum flagellum quod temporaliter incipit, et aeternis consummatur suppliciis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e153">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e155" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_3@8-10">Et non doluerunt.</quote>
            Inferuntur supplicia ut corrigantur vitia, sed non emendatur Jerusalem nec per tormenta.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e160">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e162">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e164">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e166" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_4@4-6">Forsitan pauperes sunt.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e169"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e170" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e173">Sicut illud, <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e175" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc20_13@7-15">Mittam filium meum, forsitan ipsum verebuntur<!-- check: Migne cites mt21; text matches lc20_13 --></quote>. Utitur Deus sermone dubitantis, ut ex ambiguitate sententiae et verborum suspensione <pb ed="#P" n="0017C"/> liberum hominis monstretur arbitrium.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e184">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e186">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_5@17-18">Ecce magis,</quote>
            etc. Juxta tropologiam. Qui magni putantur in Ecclesia, quia solvunt jugum et rumpunt vincula, traduntur in ignominias passionum, ut faciant quae non conveniunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e194">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e196" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_5@24-24">Vincula.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e199"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e200" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e203">Praeceptorum Dei, non Pharisaeorum, de quibus dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e205" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps2_3@1-9">Dirumpamus vincula eorum et projiciamus a nobis jugum ipsorum<!-- check: Migne cites ps1; text matches ps2_3 --></quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e213">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e215">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e217">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_6@12-13">Pardus vigilans.</quote>
            Alexandri impetum significat, qui subditis sibi variis gentibus, quasi variatus pardus contra Medos Persasque arma corripuit. Quia vero non de futuro, sed de praeterito, vel jamjamque de futuris historiam texit, ideo de Romano tacet imperio.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e224">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e226">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e228">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0017D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e232" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_7@19-20">Saturavi eos.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e235"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e236" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e239">Audiat hoc qui acceptis divitiis luxuriae serviunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e243">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e245">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e247">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e249" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_8@1-2">Equi amatores.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e252"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e253" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e256">Equis, cum non vident jumentum, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e258" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps48_13@10-17">usque ad Assimilatus est jumentis insipientibus et similis factus est illis</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e264">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e266">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e268">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e270" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_10@4-5">Et dissipate.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e273"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e274" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e277"><seg type="qs">Audiat Ecclesia quam cito muri</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">propter clementiam judicis, non propter meritum peccantium.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e286">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e288">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e290">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e292" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_12@1-2">Negaverunt Dominum,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e295"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e296" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e299">Audiat hoc Ecclesia negligens: et providentiam Dei refutans, quod et gladium et famem sustineat, nisi ventura crediderit quae dicuntur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e303">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e305">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e307">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e309" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_14@11-13">Ecce ego do,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e312"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e313" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e316"><seg type="qs">Ut increduli <pb ed="#P" n="0018A"/> sermone tuo crementur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">si supra fundamentum Christi aedificaverimus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e328">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e330">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e332">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e334" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_15@19-20">Ignorabis linguam,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e337"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e338" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e341">In Hebraeo: <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e343" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_15@22-24">Non intelliges quid loquatur.</quote> Est enim malorum solatium, si habeas hostes, quos rogare valeas, qui intelligant preces tuas.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e349">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e351">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e353">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e355" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_17@1-3">Et comedet segetes,</quote>
            etc. Vastitatem terrae describit, interfectionem multorum, abactionem pecorum, subversionem urbium et murorum, quod gladio hostili cuncta capiantur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e360">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e362">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e364">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e366" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_18@1-1">Verumtamen,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e369"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e370" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e373">Reliquiae scilicet salvae fient, vel eorum qui in Babylonem ducti sunt, vel relicti ad culturam terrae Judaeae; vel eorum qui post persecutionis ardorem, vel fuga, vel confessione fidem Deo servaverunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e377">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e379">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e381">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0018B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e385" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_19@1-3">Quod si dixeritis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e388"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e389" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e392"><seg type="qs">Tropologice. Potest hoc super haereticis accipi</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">habitate, imo servite his quorum deos colitis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e401">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e403">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e405">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e407" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_21@1-3">Audi, popule stulte.</quote>
            Proprie ad Judam loquitur et ad domum Jacob. Israel enim multo jam tempore exsulabat in Assyriis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e411">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e413" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_21@4-7">Qui non habes cor.</quote>
            Dat intelligi quod absque praecepto naturaliter debemus intelligere quae recta sunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e417">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e419" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_21@8-9">Qui habentes,</quote>
            etc. Cui simile: <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e422" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_13@7-11">oculos habent, et non videbunt,</quote> etc., <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e425" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_16@1-12">Similes illis fiant qui faciunt ea, et omnes qui confidunt in eis</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e430">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e432">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e434">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e436" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_25">Iniquitates vestrae,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e441"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e442" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e445"><seg type="qs">Si quando mare transcendat terminos</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">in quibus operariis vineae unum aeternae praemium promittitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e455">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e457">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e459">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0018C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e463" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_27@1-2">Sicut decipula.</quote>
            Dum invicem se venantur ad mortem, et aliorum damnis atque dispendiis domos suas complent, secundum illam philosophorum sententiam, <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e466">Omnis dives, aut iniquus, aut haeres iniqui.</quote> Atque utinam haec tantum ab eis fiant qui foris sunt, et non a nobis, et venientium ad nos, non manus contemplentur, sed ora.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier5-Dd1e470">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier5-Hd1e472">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e474">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e476" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_28@1-2">Incrassati sunt,</quote>
            etc. Cui simile: <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e479" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut32_15@6-12">Incrassatus, impinguatus, dilatatus, dereliquit Deum factorem suum</quote>. Et: <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e482" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_28@1-5">Incrassatus est dilectus et recalcitravit</quote><ref xml:id="gom-ier5-Rd1e484"><name xml:id="gom-ier5-Nd1e485" ref="#Jerome">Ibid.</name></ref><!-- check: attribution inside gloss body -->.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier5-d1e490">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e492" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier5_28@3-4">Et impinguati,</quote>
            etc. In divinis confisi: quasi dicat: <quote xml:id="gom-ier5-Qd1e495" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc12_19@5-15">Anima, multa bona habes posita in annos plurimos: requiesce, comede et bibe</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
